cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pale-ale, cite this repository entry and the relevant release
  surface. Use 10.5281/zenodo.19483162 for the April 2026 Gate12A frozen
  technical report, 10.5281/zenodo.19569052 for the transport-first telemetry
  note, 10.5281/zenodo.20080003 for the Gate12B bounded audit,
  10.5281/zenodo.21355572 for the Gate12C-1 companion paper, and
  10.5281/zenodo.19340221 only for the earlier replication checkpoint / prior
  release surface.
title: "pale-ale"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kawasaki"
    given-names: "Aoi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Udonburo/pale-ale"
url: "https://github.com/Udonburo/pale-ale"
license: "MPL-2.0"
abstract: >-
  pale-ale is a public-facing research sandbox for structural approaches to
  local observation, consistency, and learned systems. The current citable
  release surfaces are role-separated: 10.5281/zenodo.19483162 is the main
  frozen Gate12A technical report, 10.5281/zenodo.19569052 is the mathematical
  transport-first telemetry note, 10.5281/zenodo.20080003 is the Gate12B
  bounded audit, 10.5281/zenodo.21355572 is the Gate12C-1 companion paper, and
  10.5281/zenodo.19340221 is an earlier replication checkpoint / prior release
  surface.
